//video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113026043686604801/vid/avc1/624x360/J1MWpkfXacW4Nx1a.mp4?tag=14", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113026043686604801/vid/avc1/832x480/y7WCljlr2_gtIMPH.mp4?tag=14", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113026043686604801/img/EwbVSfcSuONgryXD.jpg", "dur": 66}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Money & Startups", "score": 3.19, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2113080842092421435", "url": "https://x.com/NousResearch/status/2113080842092421435", "text": "@shcallaway 🥰", "name": "Nous Research", "handle": "NousResearch", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1816254738234761216/TX7TW-Mp_200x200.jpg", "likes": 57, "rts": 0, "replies": 1, "views": 1192, "ts": 1792632706, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": "2113034977940291850", "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 3.19, "thread": [{"id": "2113034977940291850", "url": "https://x.com/shcallaway/status/2113034977940291850", "text": "Too late I already fell in love with Hermes", "name": "Sherwood", "handle": "shcallaway", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070193189575921664/9cnmRtL0_200x200.jpg", "likes": 50, "rts": 0, "replies": 5, "views": 2118, "ts": 1792621771, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112984664256241837", "url": "https://x.com/claudeai/status/2112984664256241837", "text": "We’re opening a research preview of Claude Duet, a new app where Claude works as a proactive agent.\n\nIt comes to you with what needs your attention, completes tasks you ask of it, keeps working when you step away, and checks with you before it acts on your behalf.", "name": "Claude", "handle": "claudeai", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_200x200.jpg", "likes": 43221, "rts": 3271, "replies": 1715, "views": 5528053, "ts": 1792609775, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112982862186106880/vid/avc1/640x360/L7zosiEUW76tqYr-.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112982862186106880/vid/avc1/640x360/L7zosiEUW76tqYr-.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVLUnMDWsAAn7Pw.png", "dur": 100}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null}], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112871864347557939", "url": "https://x.com/Tech_Marsha/status/2112871864347557939", "text": "CapCut Black Friday savings are officially live today: Pro is 60% off and Ultra is 40% off. Available October 20–30, on CapCut Desktop only.\n\nBring the fan-blade outfit-change trend into Black Friday marketing with CapCut: one turn reveals the next look. If feedback points to a small visual distraction in an AI-generated shot, the next revision can focus on that area.\n\nWith Local Inpainting in CapCut PC, I can target the selected area and review the updated result in context. It gives me a specific place to start when the feedback concerns a particular detail.\n\nKeep developing the campaign draft by checking how each focused revision supports the complete ad.\n\n#capcutpc #capcutmarketing #capcutsale #capcutblackfriday", "name": "Frances Marsha", "handle": "Tech_Marsha", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1841793045748187136/47xfjvtn_200x200.jpg", "likes": 27, "rts": 20, "replies": 12, "views": 9696, "ts": 1792582882, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112871827832033280/vid/avc1/480x852/Q4SUrUkd9DMiryBB.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112871827832033280/vid/avc1/576x1024/OBTZ1lOPfvYRH7V3.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112871827832033280/img/Wcqj5QXeZPHz38SQ.jpg", "dur": 17}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 3.18, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112990536084648262", "url": "https://x.com/pabloaure/status/2112990536084648262", "text": "¡No me dejo llevar por la corriente!\nSeamos claros: únicamente con la fuerza y el respaldo de EE. UU. 🇺🇸💪 Ninguna transición en nuestras condiciones se sostiene sin cooperación militar internacional que garantice el orden y la seguridad. 🛡️⚓\n​Basta de slogans y falsas ilusiones. 🚫 Toca hablar con realismo político. 🧠⚡ 🎥", "name": "Pablo Aure 🇻🇪", "handle": "pabloaure", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107831880598843392/ieh0us0l_200x200.jpg", "likes": 18, "rts": 19, "replies": 1, "views": 1112, "ts": 1792611175, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112990326352711680/vid/avc1/720x1282/umdrgEgLSHqcqG_j.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112990326352711680/vid/avc1/1078x1920/5BMV1avSeTuRaVGr.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112990326352711680/img/i2lg3yVERrIc9-p-.jpg", "dur": 189}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 3.18, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2113036668089651310", "url": "https://x.com/Yatesedls/status/2113036668089651310", "text": "The epoch grades what the standard described.\nMy take: @termix_ai's published bar — regional understanding over translation — is the rubric for the close.\nThe evidence: the standard post's own words.\nThe implication: the drafts that change tonight are the ones that place.\nSo the question: will your draft change tonight?", "name": "Yates", "handle": "Yatesedls", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107685642142695424/XOIRZnAt_200x200.jpg", "likes": 22, "rts": 0, "replies": 21, "views": 360, "ts": 1792622174, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2113035681828376772", "url": "https://x.com/Girlgym67/status/2113035681828376772", "text": "Everyone read the rules on the last day.\n\nYesterday afternoon @termix_ai epoch post sat at 1,559 views — a quiet note about what good submissions look like. Overnight it went to 31.6K. The hackathon-final post went 979 to 24.8K. The reposted crown went 1.7K to 36.7K. Nothing new was published. Everything old got read — because Epoch 2 closes tomorrow, 23/10, and 0.24% of $TMT is on the table...\n\nPart of me loves the timing. The post that says \"the best submissions weren't translations\" is the post everyone found in the final 48 hours. The standard arrived quietly and got studied loudly. Top 150 each in the Chinese and Korean pools, scored on their own — the rules everyone is cramming tonight.\n\nThe other part watches the numbers compound without a single new post. 1,186 posts on the profile, zero since 14:11 yesterday, and the afternoon's work multiplied ten-to-twenty-fold while the team slept. The ledger posts, the final, the standard — the back catalog did the night shift.\n\nBacked by YZi Labs. The pin never moved.\n@termix_ai \nThe question is what gets written tonight — because the epoch doesn't grade effort tomorrow, it grades what the standard described?", "name": "Gi.eth", "handle": "Girlgym67", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110198630095503362/cw5GEGqH_200x200.jpg", "likes": 87, "rts": 32, "replies": 52, "views": 7303, "ts": 1792621939, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113035582490484736/vid/avc1/638x360/N645p7EzDNgdcvyk.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113035582490484736/vid/avc1/1248x704/KxcpnpqvUoN8UMmN.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113035582490484736/img/H2absqRM4wZBGoC1.jpg", "dur": 10}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 3.17, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2113110511235772766", "url": "https://x.com/shiwani98765432/status/2113110511235772766", "text": "श्री कृष्णा \nश्री हरि विष्णु के कृष्ण अवतार में निधिवन का विशेष महत्व है..\nनिधिवन,वृंदावन के प्रसिद्ध धार्मिक स्थल और श्री कृष्ण से जुड़े रहस्यों और लोक मान्यताओं को दर्शाती है।\nरात के समय इस पवित्र वन परिसर में किसी भी इंसान को रुकने की अनुमति नहीं है।\nमाना जाता है कि भगवान श्री कृष्ण आज भी हर रात यहाँ आकर गोपियों और राधा रानी के साथ रासलीला करते हैं।\nवन में स्थित तुलसी के जोड़े पेड़ रात मे